CM vertical with raised radials
CE
SY feed=0.5in
SY bottom=25in
! voltage feed a short feed section
GW 1,21,0,0,bottom,0,0,feed+bottom,awg10
! the rest of the vertical
GW 2,21,0,0,feed+bottom,0,0,5.16,awg10
! five raised radials
! use extended thin-wire approximation for greater accuracy since feed segment is short
! use good ground
GE 0
EX 0,1,11,0,1,0
EK
GN 0,0,0,0,20,0.0303
FR 0,1,0,0,14,0
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
EN
